        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:9",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall not they teach thee, and tell thee, and utter words out of their heart?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 30
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:10",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Can the rush grow up without mire? can the flag grow without water?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 47,
            "text": "OR reeds."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:11",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Whilst it is yet in his greenness, and not cut down, it withereth before any other herb.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 12
          },
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 38
          },
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 82
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:12",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "So are the paths of all that forget God; and the hypocrite’s hope shall perish:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 6
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:13",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Whose hope shall be cut off, and whose trust shall be a spider’s web.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 53
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:14",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall lean upon his house, but it shall not stand: he shall hold it fast, but it shall not endure.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:15",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "He is green before the sun, and his branch shooteth forth in his garden.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 11,
            "text": "HEB moist; i.e., thrives."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 5
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:16",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "His roots are wrapped about the heap, and seeth the place of stones.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 38,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:17",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "If he destroy him from his place, then it shall deny him, saying, I have not seen thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 41
          },
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 65
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:18",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, this is the joy of his way, and out of the earth shall others grow.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 15
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 8:19",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 8,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
